      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 🍓 Berry Broke Baby — Price Scraper\n\n**How this works:**\n1. Every Thursday at 8am (when new flyers drop), this workflow fires\n2. Firecrawl community node batch-scrapes all grocery store berry pages\n3. AI (OpenAI) parses the scraped markdown into structured price JSON\n4. Data is stored in **n8n Data Tables** and served via webhook endpoints\n5. Berry alerts are checked and emailed to subscribers\n\n**Setup Required:**\n- Install the Firecrawl community node: `@mendable/n8n-nodes-firecrawl`\n- Add your Firecrawl API credential in n8n\n- Add your OpenAI credential\n- **Create Data Table: `berry_prices`** with columns:\n  `week` (text), `last_updated` (text), `stores_json` (text), `best_deal_json` (text), `total_prices_tracked` (number), `is_current` (text), `created_at` (text)\n- **Create Data Table: `berry_subscribers`** with columns:\n  `email` (text), `berry_types_json` (text), `max_price` (number), `subscribed_at` (text)\n- Select the Data Tables in each Data Table node after import!\n- (Optional) Add Gmail credential for alerts\n\n**Stores Tracked:**\nLoblaws · FreshCo · Longo's · No Frills · Food Basics · Walmart\n+ RedFlagDeals as a cross-store aggregator",
        "height": 620,
